## Third-Party Libraries

This project includes or links against the following third-party libraries, each with their own licenses:

### Core Compression Libraries
- **zlib** - Copyright (C) 1995-2024 Jean-loup Gailly and Mark Adler (zlib License)
- **bzip2** - Copyright (C) 1996-2024 Julian Seward (bzip2 License)
- **liblzma/XZ** - Public Domain / BSD-style license
- **libzstd** - Copyright (C) 2016-present, Yann Collet (BSD License)
- **liblzo** - Copyright (C) 2024 Markus Franz Xaver Johannes Oberhumer (GPL v2+)
- **libmspack** - Copyright (C) 2024 Stuart Caie (LGPL 2.1)
- **libbrotli** - Copyright (C) 2015 Google (MIT License)

### Image Libraries
- **libjpeg-turbo** - Copyright (C) 2009-2024 D. R. Commander et al. (BSD-style + IJG License)
- **libpng** - Copyright (C) 1995-2024 The PNG Reference Library Authors (libpng License)
- **giflib** - Copyright (C) 2024 The giflib authors (MIT License)
- **brunsli** - Copyright (C) 2017 Google (Apache 2.0)
- **packjpg** - Copyright (C) 2010-2024 packjpg authors (Custom License)
- **libavif** - Copyright (C) 2019-2024 Joe Drago (BSD 2-Clause)
- **libheif** - Copyright (C) 2024 Dirk Farin (MIT License)

### Audio Libraries
- **packmp3** - Copyright (C) 2010-2024 packmp3 authors (Custom License)
- **libflac** - Copyright (C) 2000-2024 Josh Coalson (BSD-style)
- **libvorbis** - Copyright (C) 2000-2024 Xiph.Org Foundation (BSD-style)
- **WavPack** - Copyright (C) 1998-2024 David Bryant (BSD-style)

### Game Compression (External DLL Loading)
- **Oodle SDK** - Proprietary - Epic Games Inc. (Loaded dynamically from game files)
- **Kraken/Leviathan/Mermaid/Selkie/Hydra** - Proprietary - Epic Games Inc.
- **BitKnit** - Proprietary - Epic Games Inc.
- Other proprietary game compression libraries are loaded dynamically from extracted game files and are NOT distributed with this software.

---

## NOTICE

The game compression libraries (Oodle and other proprietary formats) are NOT included in this repository.
They must be provided by the user from legally obtained game files. This software only provides
a plugin interface to load these libraries dynamically at runtime for decompression and reconstruction purposes.

Users are responsible for ensuring they have the right to use any proprietary compression libraries
they choose to load with this software.
